GENERATED VOICES
----------------

The Russian audio played by the app is generated with the Silero text-to-
speech models (https://github.com/snakers4/silero-models, model v5_5_ru),
licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0. The audio files are published in a separate
repository (manum876/Azbuka_voces) and may be used for non-commercial
purposes only, crediting Silero.

The Spanish audio of ABECÉ is published in a separate repository
(manum876/Abece_voces). It is generated with the Silero Spanish models
(CC BY-NC 4.0: non-commercial use only, crediting Silero) and with the
Piper text-to-speech engine (https://github.com/rhasspy/piper) and its
es_ES-sharvard voice (MIT), trained on the SHARVARD corpus of the
University of Edinburgh (CC BY 3.0).
